      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>What is a Nichey Gift Card?</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">A Nichey Gift Card is the perfect present for anyone who loves beauty and skincare. It can be used to purchase any product on our website and never expires.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">💳</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Purchase a Gift Card</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Browse our Gift Cards section and choose your preferred amount. Gift cards are delivered instantly via email to the recipient with a unique code.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
