      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>How to Redeem a Gift Card</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">At checkout, enter your gift card code in the discount field and click Apply. The gift card balance will be deducted from your order total automatically.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
