      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Available Amounts</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Gift cards are available in the following amounts: AED 100, AED 250, AED 500, and AED 1000. Custom amounts may also be available — contact us for more details.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
