      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Expiry & Balance</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Nichey Gift Cards never expire. If your order total is less than the gift card value, the remaining balance will stay on the card for future use.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #efefef;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">❌</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Non-Refundable</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">Gift cards cannot be returned or exchanged for cash. They are non-refundable and can only be used for purchases on nichey.store.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px 0;">
      <div style="min-width:44px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1a1a;color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">📧</div>
      <div style="padding-top:8px;"><strong>Need Help?</strong><br><span style="color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;">If you have any issues with your gift card, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nichey.store" style="color:#1a1a1a;">hello@nichey.store</a> and we'll assist you within 24 hours.</span></div>
